        r"""
        decompose(ASTNode self)

        This function allows decomposition of ASTNode into components such
        that we reduce the need for brackets. Obviously an ASTNode does not
        have brackets but when written as a string these would become
        necessary.

        The decomposition used here is such that if the top level function is
        multiply or divide then the arguments to these functions do not
        contain a plus element.

        for example

        (a + B) * c becomes ac + Bc

        (5 + 3)/(a-4) becomes 8/(a-4)

        (a + 4)/4 becomes 1 + a/4

        """
        return _libsbml.ASTNode_decompose(self)

